  "verbalization": "The visible evidence suggests a potential pathway by which Annomonicin may interact with SK-VLB, through a series of target relationships. Annomonicin is directly linked to SMMC-7721, which is a target of Methyl Orsellinate and KMDLOETUWUPGMB-UHFFFAOYSA-N, both of which target SK-VLB. This indicates that Annomonicin may influence SK-VLB via intermediate targets, possibly through a metabolic or signaling cascade. The shared involvement of SK-VLB as a target in multiple pathways underscores a possible functional role in the biological process being studied. The evidence is consistent across different paths, suggesting a robust connection, though the exact mechanism of interaction remains to be elucidated.",
